---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<style>
/* PAGE HERO */
.faq-hero { padding: 140px 0 72px; background: var(--night-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.faq-hero .page-tag { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.faq-hero h1 { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.faq-hero h1 em { color: var(--green); font-style: normal; }
.faq-hero p { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(238,241,246,0.6); max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.65; }

/* ESPEJO */
#espejo { background: var(--night); padding: 96px 0; }
.espejo-intro { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px); letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.2; max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
.espejo-intro span { color: var(--green); }
.espejo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
.espejo-q { background: var(--night-3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 24px 24px 20px; border-left: 3px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.3); transition: border-color .2s, border-left-color .2s; }
.espejo-q:hover { border-color: rgba(0,232,145,0.25); border-left-color: var(--green); }
.espejo-q p { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 16px); line-height: 1.35; color: rgba(238,241,246,0.85); }
.espejo-cta-strip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; background: rgba(0,232,145,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.15); border-radius: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.espejo-cta-txt { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px); flex: 1; min-width: 220px; }
.espejo-cta-txt span { color: var(--green); }

/* FAQ SECTIONS */
#faq-page { background: var(--night-2); padding: 96px 0; }
.faq-cats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 64px; }
.faq-cat-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 24px); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.faq-cat-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
.faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.faq-item { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .2s; }
.faq-item.open { border-color: rgba(0,232,145,.25); }
.faq-q-btn { width: 100%; background: var(--night-3); border: none; text-align: left; padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px); color: var(--offwh); letter-spacing: -.01em; line-height: 1.3; transition: background .15s; }
.faq-q-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); }
.faq-ico { flex-shrink: 0; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(0,232,145,.3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--green); transition: transform .25s; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1; }
.faq-item.open .faq-ico { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.faq-ans { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height .32s ease; }
.faq-item.open .faq-ans { max-height: 400px; }
.faq-ans-inner { padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 15px; color: rgba(238,241,246,0.7); line-height: 1.75; }
.faq-ans-inner strong { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
.faq-ans-inner a { color: var(--green); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

/* CTA FINAL */
.faq-cta-band { background: var(--night); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 80px 0; text-align: center; }
.faq-cta-band h2 { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.faq-cta-band h2 span { color: var(--green); }
.faq-cta-band p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 480px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.cta-buttons { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .espejo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .espejo-cta-strip { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
  .espejo-cta-strip .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>

<Layout
  title="FAQ · AI for SMBs · 3G Intelligence"
  description="How much does AI cost? How long does it take? Does it work for my company? We answer the real questions business owners ask before taking the step." lang="en"
>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="faq-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-tag" data-i18n="faqp-hero-tag">Frequently asked questions</div>
    <h1 data-i18n="faqp-hero-title">The questions business owners ask<br>before taking the step.</h1>
    <p data-i18n="faqp-hero-sub">No filters. No marketing. The real answers you need to decide if AI makes sense for your business today.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ESPEJO DE DOLOR -->
<section id="espejo">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="espejo-intro" data-i18n="faqp-espejo-intro">If any of these questions <span>resonates with you</span>, you already have the answer you need.</p>
    <div class="espejo-grid">
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq1">Does your team work all day... or put out fires all day?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq2">How much money does your company lose on tasks someone repeats manually every week?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq3">What process collapses first when demand increases?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq4">How many important decisions are you still making without real data?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq5">Is your company growing... or just accumulating operational chaos?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq6">What part of your operation depends too much on one single person?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq7">What will happen when your competitors do implement AI and you haven't?</p></div>
      <div class="espejo-q"><p data-i18n="faqp-eq8">Where is the most time lost in your company today — and nobody is measuring it?</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="espejo-cta-strip">
      <p class="espejo-cta-txt" data-i18n="faqp-espejo-cta-txt">The diagnosis answers <span>exactly</span> that — in less than 5 minutes.</p>
      <a href="/en/test-era" class="btn btn-primary">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span data-i18n="faqp-espejo-cta-btn">Take the free ERA Test</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ POR CATEGORÍA -->
<section id="faq-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-cats">

      <!-- CATEGORÍA 1: DINERO Y ROI -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="faqp-c1-tag">Money & ROI</div>
        <h2 class="faq-cat-title" data-i18n="faqp-c1-title">How much does it cost and how much comes back?</h2>
        <p class="faq-cat-sub" data-i18n="faqp-c1-sub">The real questions about investment, return, and risk.</p>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c1q1">How much does it cost to implement AI in an SME?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c1a1">It depends on scope. The <strong>ERA Test is free</strong>. Radar Express starts at <strong>USD 1,200</strong> depending on company size, Flight Plan from USD 6,700, and Autopilot from USD 1,500 to USD 8,000 per month — no hourly fees. If the ERA Test shows real opportunities, the Radar cost is deducted from Flight Plan if contracted within 90 days.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c1q2">How long does it take to recover the investment?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c1a2">The average case we work on shows return in <strong>4–8 months</strong>. The case published on this site recovered USD 250K in unbilled processes in the first quarter post-implementation. The diagnosis projects ROI at 12 months per opportunity before you decide whether to invest.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c1q3">How much money is my company losing on repetitive tasks today?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c1a3">That's precisely what the diagnosis measures. On average, an SME of 20–50 people loses <strong>between USD 30,000 and USD 80,000 annually</strong> on manual work that could be automated — quotes, reports, follow-ups, data entry. Most don't know because they've never measured it.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c1q4">What happens if the diagnosis shows it's not worth it?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c1a4">We tell you directly. We won't create a project where there's no real opportunity. If the diagnosis shows your company isn't ready or the ROI doesn't justify the investment, you get that report anyway — and it's yours to use however you want. We prefer clients who move forward with conviction.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CATEGORÍA 2: TIEMPO Y PROCESO -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="faqp-c2-tag">Time & process</div>
        <h2 class="faq-cat-title" data-i18n="faqp-c2-title">When will I start seeing results?</h2>
        <p class="faq-cat-sub" data-i18n="faqp-c2-sub">Real timelines, no promises of "implementation in 24 hours".</p>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c2q1">How long does it take to implement AI in my company?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c2a1">The full diagnosis takes <strong>3–4 weeks</strong>. Quick Win implementations (simple processes) execute in <strong>4–8 weeks</strong>. More complex automation projects take 2–4 months. The diagnosis tells you exactly what to expect before committing time or budget.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c2q2">How do I implement AI without breaking current operations?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c2a2">That's the right question. We never start with the critical process — we start with <strong>Quick Wins</strong>: repetitive, low-risk tasks where a failure doesn't affect the core operation. Once the team gains confidence and the process shows results, we scale. The order matters more than the technology.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c2q3">Which processes should be automated first?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c2a3">Those that combine three things: <strong>high volume, lots of manual time, and low risk if they go wrong</strong>. Typically: quotes, periodic reports, data entry between systems, client and supplier follow-ups. The diagnosis identifies and ranks them by ROI.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c2q4">Do I need to have my data organized before starting?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c2a4">Not necessarily. If the diagnosis detects data gaps, we offer a prior <strong>Data Foundation</strong> project that organizes, cleans and integrates your data. It's an optional step between the diagnosis and AI implementation — with fixed pricing based on complexity.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CATEGORÍA 3: ¿ES PARA MI EMPRESA? -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="faqp-c3-tag">Is this for my company?</div>
        <h2 class="faq-cat-title" data-i18n="faqp-c3-title">Does AI work for an SME?</h2>
        <p class="faq-cat-sub" data-i18n="faqp-c3-sub">The biggest myth holding business owners back.</p>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c3q1">Is AI only for large companies with a technology budget?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c3a1">No. The most effective AI tools for daily operations are accessible from <strong>USD 50–200 per month</strong>. The problem isn't the tool cost — it's knowing what to automate, in what order and how to integrate it without breaking what already works. That's exactly what 3GI does.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c3q2">What industries does it work best for?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c3a2">Professional services (firms, consultancies, healthcare), manufacturing, logistics and transportation, construction and certifications, trade and distribution. If your company has <strong>repeatable processes with 5–200 people</strong>, the method works — regardless of industry. What matters is that there are processes, not that the industry is "tech".</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c3q3">Can my current team use AI or do I need to hire specialists?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c3a3">Your current team can use AI — that's the goal. We don't implement solutions that require a new technical team. The architecture we deliver is designed so <strong>people without technical knowledge</strong> can operate and scale the solutions after a 1–2 hour onboarding.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c3q4">Does it work for companies outside Chile?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c3a4">Yes. We work with companies in <strong>Chile, Mexico, Colombia, Argentina and Peru</strong>. The diagnosis and all phases are done remotely — no travel cost. The only thing that varies between countries is the regulatory context, which we factor into the analysis.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CATEGORÍA 4: MIEDO A QUEDARSE ATRÁS -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="faqp-c4-tag">The time to act</div>
        <h2 class="faq-cat-title" data-i18n="faqp-c4-title">What happens if I wait?</h2>
        <p class="faq-cat-sub" data-i18n="faqp-c4-sub">The questions nobody asks out loud but everyone thinks.</p>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c4q1">What will happen when my competitors implement AI?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c4a1">Companies that implement AI first win in <strong>speed, cost and quality</strong> simultaneously. A company that quotes in 3 minutes competes differently from one that takes 35. One that invoices automatically doesn't lose revenue to oversight. The advantage isn't gradual — it's structural. And once established, it's hard to catch up to.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c4q2">Will AI replace my employees?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c4a2">Not in the way you're worried about. What AI replaces are <strong>tasks</strong>, not people. The employee who spent 35 minutes on a quote now closes more sales in the same time. The one who controlled files manually now supervises exceptions. The goal isn't to reduce headcount — it's to multiply what each person does.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c4q3">What are the risks of using AI? Errors, privacy, dependency?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c4a3">Those are real risks — and that's why the diagnosis maps them before implementing. We mitigate them with three principles: <strong>start with low-risk processes</strong>, keep data in your infrastructure (no lock-in), and don't automate critical decisions without human review. Zero risk doesn't exist — but calculated risk is manageable.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c4q4">What's the difference between hiring 3GI and buying an AI tool?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c4a4">A tool is generic. The problem is knowing which one to use, for what process, how to integrate it with what you already have, and how to get your team to adopt it. Without that, the tool becomes another unused license. 3GI doesn't sell you tools — it delivers the <strong>diagnosis, roadmap and accompaniment</strong> to make the change real and measurable.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CATEGORÍA 5: CÓMO TRABAJAMOS -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="faqp-c5-tag">How we work</div>
        <h2 class="faq-cat-title" data-i18n="faqp-c5-title">Who does the work and how?</h2>
        <p class="faq-cat-sub" data-i18n="faqp-c5-sub">No fine print. This is the real process.</p>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c5q1">Who does the work — you or do you leave me with a tool?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c5a1">We do the diagnosis, analysis and roadmap. In Flight Plan and Autopilot we accompany implementation with a dedicated consultant. <strong>This is not a course or software</strong> we hand off to you. The goal is that when we're done, your team operates autonomously — without depending on 3GI.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c5q2">How do you integrate AI with WhatsApp, Excel, CRM or my current system?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c5a2">We work with the tools you already use, not against them. We integrate with <strong>WhatsApp Business, Excel/Google Sheets, ERPs, CRMs</strong> and proprietary systems. The diagnosis maps exactly what systems you have and designs the roadmap on that basis — not on an ideal stack that doesn't exist in your company.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c5q3">What AI tools do you recommend and which are just hype?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c5a3">The tools we recommend depend on the process — there's no universal answer. What we can say: <strong>generic tools without specific implementation are almost always hype</strong>. A chatbot without integration to your systems only answers FAQs. The AI that moves the needle is connected to your real data and flows.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span data-i18n="faqp-c5q4">How do I know if my company is ready to use AI?</span><span class="faq-ico">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-ans"><div class="faq-ans-inner" data-i18n="faqp-c5a4">You don't need to be "ready" to start — you need to know where you are. The ERA Test measures exactly that: 5 dimensions of operational maturity that determine your current ERA and what level of AI you can absorb today. There are ERA 1 companies that can implement Quick Wins in weeks. Don't wait for perfection to start.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA FINAL -->
<div class="faq-cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-i18n="faqp-cta-title">Still have questions?<br><span>The diagnosis answers them all.</span></h2>
    <p data-i18n="faqp-cta-sub">In less than 5 minutes you'll know what ERA your company is in and what concrete opportunities it has today.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/en/test-era" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span data-i18n="faqp-cta-btn-diag">Take the free ERA Test</span>
